  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中國思想史(二)",
    "sub_ename": "HISTORY OF CHINESE THOUGHT(2)",
    "describe_ch": "人們為解決問題或理解事物所經歷之思維活動所產生之結果，謂之「思想」，具獨創性且自成一理論系統者謂之思想家。透過人類歷史脈絡瞭解思想發展之軌跡者謂之「思想史」。本課程將承續中國思想史（一）之脈絡，講授中國歷代哲人之思想。",
    "describe_eh": "The results of the thinking activities that people experience to solve problems or understand things are called \"thoughts\", and those who are original and self-contained are called thinkers. Those who understand the trajectory of thought development through the context of human history are called \"history of thought.\" This course will continue the context of History of Chinese Thoughts (1) and teach the thoughts of Chinese philosophers in the past dynasties.",
